      "name": "Listing Moderation",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Admin \u2014 list listings",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/listings?reviewStatus=PENDING&page=1&limit=20"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin \u2014 listing detail",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "Response includes media (full array, each item with a signed url/thumbnailUrl) and documents (full array, each item with a signed downloadUrl) for the listing's property, same signing behavior as the public /listings/{listingId}/detail endpoint. Also includes location (location, pincode, addressLine, landmark, formattedAddress, latitude, longitude, locationPrecision, showExactLocation), or null if the property has no location saved yet — unlike the public endpoint, latitude/longitude are always exact here regardless of showExactLocation.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/listings/{{listingId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin \u2014 remove listing photo",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "description": "Removes one photo from the listing's property (e.g. inappropriate content). Audits the removal and notifies the seller with the given reason, or a default message if omitted.",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Photo did not meet our content guidelines.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/listings/{{listingId}}/media/{{mediaId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin \u2014 approve and publish listing",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"note\": \"Listing approved after review\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/listings/{{listingId}}/approve"
          },
          "response": [],
          "description": "Now also re-checks the seller's (or their organization's) active-listing plan limit at approval time, not just at submit time \u2014 a seller can submit several listings while under the limit and have several approved back-to-back, so this closes that gap. Returns 403 PLAN_LIMIT_REACHED (same nested `error.details.{feature,used,limit,upgradeRequired}` shape as everywhere else) if approving this one would push the owner over their plan's listingLimit, even though it was validly submitted while under the limit at the time."
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin \u2014 reject listing",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Please provide clearer property documents.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/listings/{{listingId}}/reject"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Admin \u2014 suspend listing",
